  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3104.07 Compliance Calculation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3104.07 Compliance Calculation. The amount of DERs needed to demonstrate compliance shall be the difference between:\n\n(a) The actual emissions expressed in tons or the alternative limit under which the source will operate, and\n\n(b) The allowable emissions based on actual activity levels expressed in tons.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3100.html"
}
